# LDOC visual checks

## Comparison

@animate
Before: repeat requests hit the database, 240ms p95 response time, extra load during busy hours
After: repeat requests served from cache, 12ms p95 response time, database load down by 80 percent
@end

## Sequence

@animate
book: Lesson Book
router: API Gateway
cache: Redis Cache
queue: Event Queue
book sends CHAPTER to router
router sends LOOKUP to cache
cache replies HIT to router
router sends EVENT to queue
queue replies SAVED to router
router replies LESSON to book
@end

## How the preview works

@animate
user: Developer
laptop: Code Editor
server: LDOC Engine
screen: Live Preview
user sends script to laptop
laptop sends AST to server
server produces screen
@end
